      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1576,
        "height": 496,
        "content": "## 📧 Automated Reference Check\nIf a previous landlord email exists, sends a `sendAndWait` Gmail message with four standard questions and waits for the free-text reply. When the response arrives, GPT extracts the tenancy dates, payment history, disputes, and whether they'd rent again — then saves it to the sheet."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "8fba07ff-f70e-4306-b594-8d84ddca6dbc",
