        "content": "## 🔍 Credit Check & AI Scoring\nSends name, email, and phone to your credit bureau API (placeholder URL — replace with your provider). GPT then scores the applicant 0–100 and identifies red flags based on income ratio, rental history, and the credit result."
      },
